&lt;li&gt;Experience in translating business priorities into clear plans, timelines, and integrated go-to-market approaches.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience ideating on and reviewing creative work, upholding brand standards, and giving clear feedback that strengthens ideas and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in using performance insights and business context to recommend changes that improve future partnership strategy, planning and execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High integrity and ownership in handling sensitive information, avoiding over-reliance on AI and staying accountable for final decisions and deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
