&lt;p&gt;The Business Development Lead for AI Partnerships will source and evaluate new partnerships and manage existing strategic partnerships with strategic technology platform companies to help drive growth and engagement on Pinterest.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead partner strategy, business development, and partner management for AI at Pinterest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Actively monitor, synthesize, inform, and action the industry landscape to identify opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the process of identifying partnerships to pursue, including building the business case through strategic/financial analysis and due diligence&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Negotiate complex deals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build relationships with leaders at emerging and established companies in the AI space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate deal execution and partner management across relevant teams including product, engineering, legal, and marketing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s Degree or equivalent practical experience and 8+ years of work experience in business development with demonstrated experience leading complex deals&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing AI partnerships and/or a passion for the space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strategic, driven, and analytical with a passion for consumer technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort in navigating the evolving technology landscape and leading through ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced in performing broad quantitative analysis and negotiating complex deals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively with cross-functional senior executives in a rapidly changing environment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
