&lt;li&gt;Excellent (verbal, written, visual) communication skills, with proven ability to develop and present compelling narratives to broad audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business judgment, with an owners’ mindset and the ability to navigate ambiguity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in building trusted relationships and influencing senior stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively with people at all levels in an organization; including getting into the details to “become the expert” on an area of focus, then upleveling and clearly articulating the “so what” for others.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Curious and knowledgeable about the ads, ecommerce, and broader technology industry&lt;/li&gt;
