&lt;p&gt;Millions of people across the world come to Pinterest to find new ideas every day. It’s where they get inspiration, dream about new possibilities and plan for what matters most. Our mission is to help those people find their inspiration and create a life they love. As a Pinterest employee, you’ll be challenged to take on work that upholds this mission and pushes Pinterest forward.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the strategy, charter and operating model for a new team responsible for two major platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pinterest’s large-scale asynchronous job scheduling and execution platform, and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;its anomaly detection, root-cause analysis, and ML monitoring platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the technical roadmap &amp;amp; evolution of these platforms, advancing automation, self-service onboarding, resource efficiency and reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
