&lt;li&gt;Strengthen operational excellence across both platforms by improving observability, incident response, service health, documentation and engineering practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, coach and grow a high-performing team while establishing an inclusive culture of ownership, learning and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to accelerate planning, technical exploration, documentation and operational analysis, applying sound judgment and verification to ensure the quality and correctness of final outcomes. E.g. AI can be used for user onboarding, routine agentic evaluation of ongoing tasks.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 9 years of software engineering experience, including deep expertise in distributed platforms and solid familiarity with backend systems &amp;amp; interest in algorithms in anomaly detection domain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 2 years of engineering management experience leading strong platform &amp;amp; backend highly available engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical foundation in platform reliability, observability, Kubernetes or cloud infrastructure, data systems and developer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep understanding of distributed systems, asynchronous execution, workflow orchestration and passion for machine learning algorithms.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience setting technical strategy and delivering meaningful improvements to platform scalability, operational efficiency, customer adoption or engineering velocity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead work across platforms and collaborate effectively with cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication skills, strong technical judgment, and a people-focused leadership approach.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI to accelerate engineering planning, analysis and execution, with a clear approach to validating accuracy, quality and security.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s/Master’s degree in Computer Science, a related technical field, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
