&lt;p&gt;The Lead Client Account Manager is responsible for building and nurturing strategic partnerships with key Entertainment App advertisers in the Greater China region, driving revenue growth, and ensuring client success on the Pinterest platform. This role demands a highly strategic individual with exceptional relationship-building skills, a deep understanding of digital advertising, and a passion for the Entertainment App industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Become an expert on Pinterest&#39;s advertising products and best practices, particularly lower-funnel solutions. Educate clients on product features and benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute strategic account plans for major Greater China Entertainment App advertisers, aligned with their business objectives and marketing goals. Proactively identify growth opportunities and address challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively cultivate and sustain strong, long-term relationships with key client decision-makers, acting as a trusted advisor to understand their unique needs and provide expert guidance and support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive revenue growth through effective account management, upselling, and cross-selling. Meet and exceed revenue targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze campaign performance data, identify trends, and provide actionable insights to optimize campaigns and improve client ROI. Prepare and deliver compelling presentations to clients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate effectively with internal teams, including Ads Policy, Engineering, Measurement &amp;amp; Insights, Product Marketing, Creative Strategy, and Performance Solutions, to ensure client needs are met.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and guide other account managers, fostering a collaborative and high-performing team environment. Share best practices and provide ongoing support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay up-to-date on industry trends, competitor activity, and the evolving digital advertising landscape, particularly within the Greater China Entertainment App sector.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 10 years of experience in digital advertising sales, managing high-value relationships, driving strategic learning agendas, and leading client communication.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Greater China Export advertisers,&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills and experience managing projects that involve multiple stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated and result-oriented, ability to analyze sales data and make data-driven decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative team player who can work effectively in a fast-paced environment with both technical and non-technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid technical foundation and relevant experience in Search/Shopping/App/Social advertising technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in business Mandarin and English is required for business purposes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with Entertainment App advertisers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable with 30% of business travel for this position.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relocation Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position is not eligible for relocation assistance. Visit our&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/pinflex/&quot;&gt; PinFlex&lt;/a&gt; page to learn more about our working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
