&lt;p&gt;You will serve as a strategic advisor to clients navigating complex business priorities, evolving media strategies, and multiple measurement sources of truth. You will move quickly to understand each account, identify opportunities for growth, mobilize internal partners, and connect Pinterest’s full-funnel solutions to client outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
