&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead multi-quarter account strategies and joint business plans for complex Financial Services partnerships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain trusted relationships across agency and direct client stakeholders at all levels, including senior executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive revenue growth through strategic pitches, renewals, expansions, quality pipeline development, and product adoption.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop full-funnel media strategies spanning brand, consideration, conversion, and measurement solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engage in robust media, creative, and measurement discussions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate performance and measurement learnings into clear recommendations, test-and-learn agendas, and investment decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with the CAM to create clear account coverage, operating rhythms, and accountability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobilize cross-functional teams to solve client, measurement, product, technical, creative, and commercial challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead executive-ready conversations, negotiations, escalations, and business reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
