&lt;li&gt;A track record of creating revenue growth, quality pipeline, and measurable change within complex accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience managing both agency and direct client relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Executive presence and the ability to influence stakeholders from junior practitioners through C-suite leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of full-funnel digital advertising, media strategy, and measurement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to move quickly, operate with ambiguity, and make sound decisions with incomplete or conflicting information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent strategic storytelling, commercial judgment, negotiation, and cross-functional leadership skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative, growth-oriented approach and the ability to use AI to accelerate preparation, analysis, and follow-through while maintaining accuracy and ownership of outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in a relevant field such as Marketing, or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
