&lt;li&gt;Contribute to applied machine learning and AI research that informs Pinterest product experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect, analyze and synthesize data to develop data-driven machine learning models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, efficient and maintainable code, supported by appropriate documentation and testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply relevant machine learning techniques, including natural language processing or graph-based approaches, to modeling and ranking problems across discovery, ads and search&lt;/li&gt;
