&lt;p&gt;You will work across Ads and Consumer engineering teams to define durable platform capabilities, modernize frameworks, and unlock faster product iteration with high confidence in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead a team of high-caliber software engineers. You&#39;ll be responsible for hiring, performance management, career development, and fostering an inclusive, high-output team culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead engineering team and strategy focused on serving reliability across both ads and consumer serving platforms, production change management at scale, and developer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure platform reliability, high availability, and operational excellence across the end-to-end ad-request lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain safeguard automation, including canarying rollouts, configuration verification, automated regression testing, and launch readiness frameworks to eliminate toil and catch issues prior to broad production releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive infrastructure modernization initiatives, ensuring serving infrastructure is adopting company wide advancements and fleet upgrades.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive operational excellence, infrastructure performance, cost efficiency, and compliance controls while supporting business growth at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to accelerate analysis, debugging, design exploration, and iteration while applying sound engineering judgment and validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the quality bar through design reviews, code reviews, documentation, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers and scale technical leadership across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of Management experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience managing software engineering teams and maintaining large-scale ads and consumer serving platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success in hiring, performance management, career development, and fostering inclusive team environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in production change management at scale, automating away operational toil, launch readiness verification, canarying rollouts, configuration verification, and serving platform reliability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to make sound tradeoffs across latency, reliability, scalability, cost, and developer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills with technical and cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in one or more programming languages such as Java, C++, Go, or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track record of driving operational excellence, meeting strict serving latency SLAs, and optimizing cost-per-impression at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to use AI to improve the speed and quality of day-to-day engineering workflows, with a rigorous approach to testing, validation, and responsible use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, a related technical field, or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Preferred qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ads delivery, recommendation or search serving, retrieval, ranking, or experimentation systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with serving-framework migrations, platform consolidation, or developer tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability, production debugging, traffic management, or incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
