&lt;li&gt;June 14, 2027 - September 3, 2027&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to our product roadmap and mission - to bring everyone the inspiration to create a life they love - using data and exploratory analysis to understand user behavior and trends, and identify opportunities for product innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and implement core metrics that guide the team efforts and help design and evaluate A/B experiments that drive these metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore alternative experimentation techniques to help internal teams evaluate their ideas faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work cross-functionally to build and communicate key insights, and collaborate closely with product managers, engineers, designers, and researchers to help build the next experiences on Pinterest.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
