&lt;li&gt;8+ years of experience of building and support large scalable Kubernetes or big data platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of big data / ML technologies (e.g. Flink, Spark, Presto, Kubernetes, Ray, PyTorch/TensorFlow)&lt;/li&gt;
