&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This position may be eligible for relocation assistance. Visit our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/pinflex/&quot;&gt;PinFlex&lt;/a&gt; page to learn more about our working model.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Information regarding the culture at Pinterest and benefits available for this position can be found &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.pinterestcareers.com/pinterest-life/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
