&lt;p&gt;The Senior Client Account Manager is responsible for building and nurturing strategic partnerships with key Entertainment App advertisers in the Greater China region, driving revenue growth, and ensuring client success on the Pinterest platform. This role demands a highly strategic individual with exceptional relationship-building skills, a deep understanding of digital advertising, and a passion for the Entertainment App industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
