&lt;p&gt;You’ll partner with a broad, multi-functional client group across the Global Business Organization, engineering, product, design, marketing, communications, creative, recruiting, legal and business affairs and finance. In this high-impact role, you’ll shape the regional People agenda and help Pinterest scale thoughtfully across a complex and evolving APAC market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the VP of APAC Sales and regional leadership teams to translate business priorities into People strategies that support growth, performance and organizational effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a trusted advisor to senior leaders on organizational health, leadership capability, team effectiveness, employee experience and change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead APAC talent priorities, including workforce planning, talent reviews, succession planning, leadership development, career growth and performance management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive organizational effectiveness through organization design, team structure, decision-making clarity, change readiness and scalable operating models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide leaders through restructuring, business evolution and other complex change efforts while balancing business needs, employee experience and risk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion a consistent and inclusive employee experience across APAC, partnering with Employee Relations and other People teams on complex employee matters and local requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect regional leaders, People Business Partners and Centers of Excellence to align local needs with global People strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use workforce insights, data and AI-enabled tools to improve decision-making, scale People practices and strengthen organizational effectiveness. Apply sound judgment, verification and responsible data stewardship to AI-assisted work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help bring Pinterest’s culture and values to life across APAC in ways that are inclusive, meaningful and locally relevant.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
