&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute standard and custom research studies for Pinterest&#39;s partners to analyse advertising effectiveness using internal and external measurement tools to include, but not limited to, Brand Lift, Conversion Reporting and Sales lift.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with clients and agencies to measure the true business value by developing and implementing measurement strategies to enhance business outcomes and build learning agendas for long term growth.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Having an in-depth understanding of the broader measurement ecosystem, you will identify new opportunities for future measurement capabilities and improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on in-depth scaled analysis/projects to drive improved results for clients. Independently manage these to include the project strategy, vision, and goals, and align them with the organisation&#39;s strategy and goals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working collaboratively as a cross functional partner you will manage relationships with internal clients, building credibility and trust in our solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum 6 years of relevant experience in digital ads measurement, performance marketing, or adtech&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in economics, business administration, communication science, media informatics, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of designing and executing research studies, conducting complex data analysis, and delivering strategic, actionable insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in advanced measurement frameworks and web analytics solutions, such as MTA, Google Analytics, Adobe Analytics, and MMM&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of the evolving privacy landscape, signal loss, and modern measurement methodologies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-starter with strong ownership, capable of navigating ambiguity to consult key clients and elevate their measurement maturity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creative, forward-thinking measurement leader passionate about industry innovation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent interpersonal and communication skills, with a demonstrated ability to influence stakeholders across all organizational levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive experience partnering directly with advertisers and agencies across Northern Europe to address complex measurement challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative team player adept at cross-functional alignment across sales, product, external partners, and regional client teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience leveraging AI tools to optimize workflows, documentation, and reporting, with a strong commitment to quality control and accuracy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Professional fluency in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
