&lt;li&gt;This role will need to be in the office for in-person collaboration 1-2 times/quarter and can be situated anywhere in the USA.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
