&lt;p&gt;You will work across Ads and Core engineering teams to define durable platform capabilities, modernize frameworks, and unlock faster product iteration with high confidence in production.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set technical direction and lead architecture for major serving-platform initiatives across Ads and Core.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and operate scalable, highly available systems with clear performance, reliability, and efficiency goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product, ML, infrastructure, and Core/Ads engineering teams to translate complex requirements into reusable platform capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the serving stack through framework modernization, API evolution, experimentation controls, observability, and debugging tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead complex projects end to end: technical strategy, design, implementation, rollout, adoption, and operational readiness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI to accelerate analysis, debugging, design exploration, and iteration while applying sound engineering judgment and validation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Raise the quality bar through design reviews, code reviews, documentation, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers and scale technical leadership across the organization.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;8+ years of software engineering experience building and operating production backend or distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading complex technical initiatives across teams or organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong expertise in distributed systems, online serving, low-latency services, or infrastructure platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to make sound tradeoffs across latency, reliability, scalability, cost, and developer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and collaboration skills with technical and cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in one or more programming languages such as Java, C++, Go, or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience mentoring engineers and elevating technical standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to use AI to improve the speed and quality of day-to-day engineering workflows, with a rigorous approach to testing, validation, and responsible use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, a related technical field, or equivalent experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with ads delivery, recommendation or search serving, retrieval, ranking, or experimentation systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with serving-framework migrations, platform consolidation, or developer tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability, production debugging, traffic management, or incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
