&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the engineering team responsible for the App Promotion objective and App Install Optimization, owning delivery from beta through GA.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product, Design, and PMM to define and refine the advertiser experience for App Promotion in Ads Manager, including campaign creation, targeting, optimization, and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with Ads Quality, ML, and infra teams to ensure robust serving, modeling, and experimentation for app promotion campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Measurement, Reporting, and Partner teams to close SKAN and MMP attribution gaps and ensure App Promotion reporting is accurate and trusted.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish and maintain strong engineering practices for App Promotion, including design reviews, experimentation standards, on-call, monitoring, and incident response.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hire, coach, and develop a diverse team of engineers; foster a culture of inclusion, learning, and operational excellence.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s or higher degree in Computer Science or a related technical field, or equivalent practical experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Several years of engineering management experience leading full stack and/or mobile teams shipping production systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in performance, growth, or ads engineering, preferably with app install, app engagement, or lower-funnel objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to lead complex, cross-functional projects involving Product, Data, Design, and other engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong technical judgment and ability to dive deep into architecture, data quality, and measurement details when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills and the ability to explain strategy, tradeoffs, and technical decisions to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commitment to building inclusive teams and promoting a sense of belonging.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
